begincodeV2
name:技能'添加到守方玩家炮塔
params:String key,Long amount,Struct player
lines:
String uid=varf Struct.player.getString(String id:Bool 1)
Bool exist=varf Dict.守方炮塔记录.contains(var uid)
if{fun bool.not(var exist)
  act 1101.this.炮塔'守方放置或升级(var player:Long 1)
}
Mech target=varf Dict.守方炮塔记录.readMech(var uid:Bool 0)
act 1101.this.技能'通用添加方法(var target:var key:var amount:var player)
endcode